                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I Don't really know how to put this: It is exactly what I've been looking for when it comes to drawing things. Granted, the graphics seem a little poor for the grid you build on, but when I found this, I was looking primarily for something to draw 2d maps, and that is easy enough, although I wish it came with instructions.\n\nTab - Item Menu\nSpace - Down, relative to where you are looking.\nQ - Rotate an item\nE - Rotate an item in a way different than Q\nShift - Works like sprinting in terms of movement, and works with space.",
